{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831650/extras/154c69fca9cc05a627459f4d7d606978.poster.avif?t=1755730662\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831650/extras/154c69fca9cc05a627459f4d7d606978.webm?t=1755730662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831650/extras/e5e987d0d4f787ebdebc834f5a388395.poster.avif?t=1755730662\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831650/extras/e5e987d0d4f787ebdebc834f5a388395.webm?t=1755730662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831650/extras/e5e987d0d4f787ebdebc834f5a388395.mp4?t=1755730662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed with the Deathlust, you must slaughter the Angels of the Overworld to stay alive. Ascend the Sacred Circles and try to end the Deathlust for all of demon-kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831650/extras/b10cd5eb91d0bcf66e149be0994e9813.poster.avif?t=1755730662\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831650/extras/b10cd5eb91d0bcf66e149be0994e9813.webm?t=1755730662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831650/extras/69652a3caebb56dcff4da7f43b9eb4e5.poster.avif?t=1755730662\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831650/extras/69652a3caebb56dcff4da7f43b9eb4e5.webm?t=1755730662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831650/extras/69652a3caebb56dcff4da7f43b9eb4e5.mp4?t=1755730662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Angels of the Overworld specialize in many different types of Magic, from Poison Arrows, Deadly Incantations, and insta-kill spells. Destroy them all before they end your life and your chance at Freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831650/extras/13fe2cda97858c2b2abb4ccf9e7eb5ce.poster.avif?t=1755730662\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831650/extras/13fe2cda97858c2b2abb4ccf9e7eb5ce.webm?t=1755730662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831650/extras/e35e2941d0e8c9a2b64067cedb259f89.poster.avif?t=1755730662\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831650/extras/e35e2941d0e8c9a2b64067cedb259f89.webm?t=1755730662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831650/extras/e35e2941d0e8c9a2b64067cedb259f89.mp